<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-ENGLAND WIN NZ TOUR MATCH BY AN INNINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND WIN NZ TOUR MATCH BY AN INNINGS.</headline>
<dateline>PALMERSTON NORTH, New Zealand 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>England</p>
<p>beat a New Zealand Selection XI by an innings and 113 runs in</p>
<p>their four-day cricket tour match at Palmerston North on</p>
<p>Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores: </p>
<p>New Zealand Selection XI first innings 138. Second innings</p>
<p>176 (B. Pocock 43, P. Tufnell five for 58).</p>
<p>England first innings 427-8 declared (A. Stewart 153 retired</p>
<p>hurt, N. Hussain 139)</p>
</text>
